@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FFFFFF
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"

package "Backend (FastAPI)" {
  [presentation/api.py] as API
  [application/usecases.py] as UC
  [domain/entities.py] as ENT
  [domain/enums.py] as ENM
  [infrastructure/repositories.py] as REPO
  [infrastructure/seed.py] as SEED
  [infrastructure/models.py] as MODEL
  [infrastructure/db.py] as DB
}

package "Frontend (React)" {
  [pages/*] as PAGES
  [services/api.ts] as FEAPI
  [utils/*] as UTILS
}

DB --> MODEL
MODEL --> REPO
REPO --> UC
UC --> API

FEAPI --> API
PAGES --> FEAPI
PAGES --> UTILS

SEED --> MODEL
SEED --> ENM
ENT --> ENM

note right of SEED
Seed coverage:
- Plan/Request/Execution
  statuses all included
- BudgetTxType all included
- actual_amount: None / >0
end note

@enduml
